  "questions": [
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u1:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u1",
      "unit_position": 1,
      "raw_text": "💻 面了百度健康的 Go 后端岗位，面试官全程“拷打式提问”，从短链系统到点赞设计，再到微服务与 Http/GRPC，全程技术满点！\n来给大家还原这场面试 👇",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u2:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u2",
      "unit_position": 2,
      "raw_text": "🎯 面试问题倾向\n整理下来，主要分三大类：\n① 系统设计 & 数据结构\n* 短链接是如何实现的？\n* 点赞数以及点赞用户如何设计？\n* 表结构如何设计？什么时候写入、生成短链、分发？\n* 项目整体流程展开讲解\n👉 倾向点：考察你能否 从需求到落地完整思路清晰地讲清楚，尤其是高并发场景下的设计。",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u3:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u3",
      "unit_position": 3,
      "raw_text": "* DNS 原理，域名如何解析成 IP？\n* Http 流程详解\n* Http 与 GRPC 的区别\n* 服务 A 如何找到服务 B？服务注册是怎么做的？\n👉 倾向点：关注 微服务间调用、协议理解与线上可行性**，面试官喜欢结合项目讲场景。",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u7:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u7",
      "unit_position": 7,
      "raw_text": "1. 系统设计要完整：短链、点赞系统不仅写出来，更要讲清楚 流程、缓存、并发控制。",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u8:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u8",
      "unit_position": 8,
      "raw_text": "2. 协议与微服务结合场景：Http/GRPC、服务发现、注册中心，一定要能口头复述流程。",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u9:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u9",
      "unit_position": 9,
      "raw_text": "3. 并发算法要讲思路：面试官更看重你 协程逻辑清晰、channel 控制合理，而不是光写出结果。",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u10:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u10",
      "unit_position": 10,
      "raw_text": "4. 项目经验要贴实战：高并发、性能优化、服务调用场景，都能加分。",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
